# Claude Code, interactive, with the task as its first message.
# ${TASK} is the job's PROMPT followed by the standard instructions for reporting a result.
REQUIRE claude
TMUX claude --dangerously-skip-permissions ${ARGS} ${TASK}
# The banner only appears once Claude Code is past its start-up prompts. If the project
# directory has never been trusted on this host, or the login has expired, this times out
# and the failure reason quotes what the screen showed instead.
EXPECT "Claude Code v" TIMEOUT 45
STOP TYPE "/exit" Enter
